## Overview

- The twelve families share visibility, reduced-motion and spring physics; continuous work stops when inactive.
- Changing text values goes through `TxTextMorph`; no second text diff or physics engine is added.
- Install from the Pro barrel; DitherChart also has the `@talex-touch/tuffex/charts` entry and ships in npm 0.7.0.

## Technologies

- Source adaptations keep Amicro's MIT attribution and source-file Apache-2.0 notices; Lucide glyph data keeps its ISC and applicable Feather-MIT notices, with no React or Lucide runtime dependency.

